SUBENT        D8129001   20260916   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                  9         19
TITLE      Light charged particles production from reaction of
           protons with 90Zr nucleus at 22 MeV energy
AUTHOR     (B.M.Sadykov, T.K.Zholdybayev, B.Duisebayev,
            G.Ussabayeva, A.Temirzhanov, Zh.Mukan, K.M.Ismailov)
INSTITUTE  (4KASKAZ,4KASNZR)
           (4KASKAS) Abai Kazakh National Pedagogical University,
            Almaty; Satbayev University, Almaty
REFERENCE  (J,IMP/E,35,2641009,2026)
SAMPLE     (40-ZR-90,ENR=0.95)
           90Zr foil (2.1 mg/cm2) mounted at an angle of 45 deg
            relative to the beam axis
METHOD     (EDE,BCINT)
FACILITY   (ISOCY,4KASKAZ) U-150M
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total uncertainty
           (ERR-1,,5.)  Target thickness                 (<5%)
           (ERR-2)      Current integrator calibration   (~1%)
           (ERR-3,,1.3) Solid angle of spectrometer    (<1.3%)
           (ERR-4)      Beam energy determination         (1%)
HISTORY    (20260914C) TZ
ENDBIB              19
COMMON               3          3
EN         ERR-2      ERR-4
MEV        PER-CENT   PER-CENT
 22.        1.         1.
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           26
